summary: Copy vmcore from a SSH target.
description: |
    The testcase it to copy vmcore from the previous Kdump SSH target for later
    vmcore analysis. It can be used in a multihost test or in a single host test
    by specifying your SSH server via param 'SSH_SERVER'.
contact: Kdump QE <kdump-qe-list@redhat.com>
test: chmod a+x ./runtest.sh; ./runtest.sh
framework: shell
require:
  - openssh-clients
duration: 90m
extra-summary: /kernel/kdump/copy-ssh
extra-task: /kernel/kdump/copy-ssh
